/-!
# Intrinsic Ω₄⁺(4) model facts for the swapped-component branch

This umbrella exports the actual natural binary module and the equivariant
transport and critical-line consequences used by the proof of 13.8.16(1).
It also exports the determinant-model comparison, displacement rank at least
four on every nonidentity element of the actual carrier, the binary
normalizer's absence of transvections, and order four/fixed codimension four
for nontrivial quadratic actors.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, 13.8.16(1), printed pp.952–953 (PDF pp.969–970).
-/
